BEGIN IMMEDIATE;

-- v0.34 adds six heroic-epic series in the existing story_series tables:
-- Greek heroes (Apollodorus, Library 2.4-2.8), the Argonauts (Apollonius,
-- Books I-IV), the twilight of the gods (Gylfaginning 49-53, with a long
-- version of the Ragnarok story that until now was a deliberate outline),
-- the Saga of the Volsungs (ch. 1-32), the Tain Bo Cuailnge and the Four
-- Branches of the Mabinogi. Every section keeps its own anchor claim with
-- evidence at the same locator; skipped chapters are named, not filled in.
-- Middle Welsh is registered as a language for the Mabinogi names.

